  <data name="Cleanup_TrimText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Asks every app this account can reach to give back the memory it is not actively using. Nax-TaskManager itself is skipped. "In use" drops, but the pages only move to the standby or modified list, and apps read them back in as they need them, which can make them briefly slower.</value></data>
